# Dyadrine, Synthesis Amalgam: "remove a +1/+1 counter from each of two creatures you control." Bot1 attacks with Dyadrine (two
# counters) while it also controls a Walking Ballista (one counter) and a Boommobile, a Vehicle that is not a creature although its
# exhaust gave it a +1/+1 counter; Bot2 controls a Walking Ballista with a counter too. The Boommobile (not a creature) and Bot2's
# Ballista (not Bot1's) are not offered (refused), and taking two counters from Dyadrine is refused; the removal that works takes
# one counter from Dyadrine and one from Bot1's Ballista (its last, so it dies).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Pearl
Dyadrine, Synthesis Amalgam
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Walking Ballista
Black Lotus
Boommobile
Swamp x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Walking Ballista
Swamp x10

